From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Settings top level is one flat list on BlackBerry 7

Owner decision 2026-11-19. On the BBOS 7 profile (Settings.Secure sable_profile
is bb7) the Settings homepage is one flat Options-style list: the same screen
as the ten BlackBerry 10 rows, with the six grouped rows replaced by the
entries they group (res/xml/top_level_settings_bb7.xml), so every entry keeps
its key, controller, summary and visibility rules. BBOS 10 keeps the ten rows.
---
 res/xml/top_level_settings_bb7.xml                          | 309 ++++++++++++++++++++
 src/com/android/settings/homepage/TopLevelSettings.java     |   8 +++++++-
 2 files changed, 316 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/res/xml/top_level_settings_bb7.xml b/res/xml/top_level_settings_bb7.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..274a222
--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/xml/top_level_settings_bb7.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,309 @@
